; Expect: GetSamplerFilterMin: the sampler [0-9]+ does not exist
; A debug build (-d) stops a sampler command on a sampler that is freed already. Other builds let it do nothing.
If GetEnv$("BLITZLLVM_TEST_DEBUG") = "" Then RuntimeError("GetSamplerFilterMin: the sampler 1 does not exist (release build, not checked).")
s = CreateSampler()
FreeSampler s
Print GetSamplerFilterMin(s)
Print "GetSamplerFilterMin did not stop the program."
